# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the SQL Server harnesses (driver_mssql
# Stage 2). Only the ODBC driver manager and Microsoft's driver's own
# one-time, process-lifetime allocations - the same idea as the Oracle
# harnesses' suppressions for libclntsh. Anything allocated by our own
# code is still reported.
leak:libodbc.so
leak:libodbcinst.so
leak:libmsodbcsql
